      ],
      "text": "The agent runtime builds on the pi project (@mariozechner/pi-ai and @mariozechner/pi-agent-core by Mario Zechner), and the provider bank includes Gemini, Moonshot, MiniMax, OpenRouter, Ollama, and other OpenAI-compatible services."
    },
